{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>I will greatly multiply</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here, and the other: \"הרבה ארבה את זרעך\" (I will greatly multiply your seed). The meaning of \"your sorrow\" is the blood of menstruation — a hint to what is said: every woman whose blood is abundant, her children are abundant."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:40.126072046Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}